===================================================
t3_c1    t1_c1    
1     1     
2     null     

===================================================
    
Case 3: the SEMI JOIN reads the inner side t4 of a LEFT OUTER JOIN, then a RIGHT OUTER JOIN on t4; the t3 row that matches no t4 row stays     

===================================================
